# Firebot Fleet Mosquitto ACL 模板（按 username=DEVICE_ID 做 namespace 隔离）
#
# 本模板配合：username = DEVICE_ID（firebot-vehicle-XX）
# 规则语义：
#   - 每辆车只能 publish 自己的 telemetry/status/location/heartbeat/ack/task_status
#   - 每辆车只能 subscribe 自己的 command
#   - 绝对不能访问 robot/<其它DEVICE_ID>/#
#
# 部署：mosquitto.conf 中 acl_file 指向本文件；新增车辆无需改 ACL（pattern 自动覆盖）。

# 平台（服务器）账号拥有 fleet 级读写（部署时替换为真实 platform 账号）
user platform
topic readwrite robot/#
topic readwrite $SYS/#

# 设备账号：只允许自己的 namespace
user firebot-vehicle-01
topic read robot/firebot-vehicle-01/command
topic write robot/firebot-vehicle-01/heartbeat
topic write robot/firebot-vehicle-01/status
topic write robot/firebot-vehicle-01/location
topic write robot/firebot-vehicle-01/availability
topic write robot/firebot-vehicle-01/capabilities
topic write robot/firebot-vehicle-01/command_ack
topic write robot/firebot-vehicle-01/task_status
topic write robot/firebot-vehicle-01/sensor
topic write robot/firebot-vehicle-01/battery

user firebot-vehicle-02
topic read robot/firebot-vehicle-02/command
topic write robot/firebot-vehicle-02/heartbeat
topic write robot/firebot-vehicle-02/status
topic write robot/firebot-vehicle-02/location
topic write robot/firebot-vehicle-02/availability
topic write robot/firebot-vehicle-02/capabilities
topic write robot/firebot-vehicle-02/command_ack
topic write robot/firebot-vehicle-02/task_status
topic write robot/firebot-vehicle-02/sensor
topic write robot/firebot-vehicle-02/battery

# 默认拒绝其它所有访问（fail-closed）
user anonymous
topic readwrite #
